	myDescription "aurabesh = false, branch = \"MAIN\", contextComment = \"Datapad message\", enabled = true, guid = #7110821465DF072000409B6B792D8FE4, lineVersion = 11, maxLength = 0, productId = -1, sectionId = 8557, text = \"Our expedition to the Fallen Mound was a journey into the unknown. This mound, nestled in the heart of the steppes, is a testament to the planet’s tumultuous weather. The abandoned weather station, a casualty of the mound’s collapse, stands as a stark reminder of the area’s inherent dangers.\n\nAt its heart, we discovered an artifact of significant interest – an inconspicuous piece of amberine that some believe has health-preserving properties.\n\nRegretfully, we had to abandon the research site after some local predators attacked our encampment.\n\nDoctor Maia Revlin\", type = \"MenuLine\""
